ewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M2 4.5h4l1 1h7v7a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H2v-9Z\"/></svg><span class=\"b2-tool-label\">Move</span></button>\n    <button class=\"b2-tool\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M2 8 8 2l6 6-6 6z\"/><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg><span class=\"b2-tool-label\">Categorize</span></button>\n    <button class=\"b2-tool\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M4 2v12M4 3h8l-1.5 3L12 9H4\"/></svg><span class=\"b2-tool-label\">Flag</span></button>\n    <button class=\"b2-tool\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M2 4h12v8H2zM2 4l6 4 6-4\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"4\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#0078d4\"/></svg><span class=\"b2-tool-label\">Mark<br/>unread</span></button>\n    <button class=\"b2-tool\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M5 6h3L5 10h3\"/></svg><span class=\"b2-tool-label\">Snooze</span></button>\n    <button class=\"b2-tool\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M4 6V2h8v4M4 12H2.5A.5.5 0 0 1 2 11.5V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5.5H12M4 9h8v5H4z\"/></svg><span class=\"b2-tool-label\">Print</span></button>\n    <button class=\"b2-tool\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g fill=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"3\" cy=\"8\" r=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"8\" r=\"1.2\"/></g></svg><span class=\"b2-tool-label\">More</span></button>\n    <span class=\"b2-tool-spacer\"></span>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Reader content -->\n  <div class=\"b2-reader\">\n    <div class=\"b2-reader-inner\">\n      <div class=\"b2-summary-row\">\n        <span class=\"b2-summary-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"#5b5fc7\" d=\"M8 1l1.4 3.6L13 6l-3.6 1.4L8 11 6.6 7.4 3 6l3.6-1.4zM12.5 10l.7 1.8L15 12.5l-1.8.7L12.5 15l-.7-1.8L10 12.5l1.8-.7z\"/></svg></span>\n        <span>Summarize this email</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"b2-sender-card\">\n        <div class=\"b2-avatar\">JP</div>\n        <div class=\"b2-sender-meta\">\n          <div class=\"b2-sender-line1\">\n            <span class=\"b2-sender-name\">Jordan Park</span>\n            <span class=\"b2-sender-email\">&lt;jordan.park@contoso.com&gt;</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"b2-recipients-line\">\n            <span class=\"b2-recipients-label\">To:</span>\n            <span class=\"b2-recipient\">Alex Chen</span><span style=\"color:#605e5c\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"b2-recipient\">Sam Rivera</span><span style=\"color:#605e5c\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"b2-recipient\">Morgan Singh</span>\n            <span class=\"b2-recipients-more\">+2 more</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"b2-sender-actions\">\n          <span class=\"b2-sender-time\">Tue 4/14/2026 11:42 AM</span>\n          <button class=\"b2-icon-btn\" aria-label=\"React\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"7\" r=\".8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"7\" r=\".8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" d=\"M5.5 10.5c.7.8 1.6 1.2 2.5 1.2s1.8-.4 2.5-1.2\"/></svg></button>\n          <button class=\"b2-mini-action\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M7 5 3 8.5 7 12M3 8.5h6.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 13 12\"/></svg><span>Reply</span></button>\n          <button class=\"b2-mini-action\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M5 5 1 8.5 5 12M9 5 5 8.5 9 12M5 8.5h5.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 14 12\"/></svg><span>Reply all</span></button>\n          <button class=\"b2-mini-action\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9 5l4 3.5L9 12M13 8.5H6.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 0 3 12\"/></svg><span>Forward</span></button>\n          <button class=\"b2-icon-btn\" aria-label=\"More\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g fill=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"3\" cy=\"8\" r=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"8\" r=\"1.2\"/></g></svg></button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <h1 class=\"b2-subject-h1\">Updated Q4 Roadmap timeline &mdash; please review by Friday</h1>\n\n      <div class=\"b2-body\">\n        <p>Hi Alex,</p>\n        <p>Following our sync yesterday, I&rsquo;ve updated the Q4 roadmap document with the revised milestone dates. The biggest change is shifting the Phase 2 launch from October 14 to November 4 &mdash; this gives the platform team an extra three weeks to harden the ingestion pipeline before customer onboarding begins.</p>\n        <p>A few items I&rsquo;d like your sign-off on before Friday&rsquo;s leadership review:</p>\n        <ol>\n          <li>The new Phase 2 date and the downstream impact on the Phase 3 pilot (now starting November 18 instead of November 1).</li>\n          <li>The reallocation of two engineers from the analytics workstream to the platform workstream for weeks 42&ndash;45.</li>\n          <li>Whether we should pre-brief the customer success team or wait for the official announcement on Wednesday.</li>\n        </ol>\n        <p>I&rsquo;ve also added Casey and Morgan as reviewers since they own the dependent integrations. If you spot anything else that needs adjusting, please leave inline comments and I&rsquo;ll consolidate them tomorrow morning.</p>\n        <p class=\"b2-sig\">Thanks,<br/>Jordan</p>\n\n        <div class=\"b2-quoted\">\n          <div class=\"b2-quoted-headers\">\n            <b>From:</b> Jordan Park &lt;jordan.park@contoso.com&gt;<br/>\n            <b>Sent:</b> Monday, April 13, 2026 4:18 PM<br/>\n            <b>To:</b> Alex Chen &lt;alex.chen@contoso.com&gt;<br/>\n            <b>Subject:</b> RE: Q4 Roadmap timeline &mdash; initial draft\n          </div>\n          <p>Quick note before I head out &mdash; I&rsquo;ll have the revised dates ready by tomorrow morning. Talk soon.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Collapsed reply composer -->\n  <div class=\"b2-composer\">\n    <div class=\"b2-composer-inner\">\n      <div class=\"b2-composer-pill\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M7 5 3 8.5 7 12M3 8.5h6.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 13 12\"/></svg>\n        <span>Reply to Jordan Park</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"b2-composer-actions\">\n        <button class=\"b2-mini-action\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M5 5 1 8.5 5 12M9 5 5 8.5 9 12M5 8.5h5.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 14 12\"/></svg><span>Reply all</span></button>\n        <button class=\"b2-mini-action\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9 5l4 3.5L9 12M13 8.5H6.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 0 3 12\"/></svg><span>Forward</span></button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      }
